Scope: Convert the three Stage 1 agent types from their opencode sources: `qrspi-goals` (Stage 1 orchestrator — captures user intent, dispatches synthesizer and reviewer, runs human gate), `qrspi-goals-synthesizer` (distills interview record into goals.md and config.md), and `qrspi-goals-reviewer` (checklist review of goals artifacts). Each file follows the pi agent type convention with YAML frontmatter (`description`, `tools`, `model`, `thinking`, `max_turns`, `prompt_mode`, `extensions`) and system prompt body adapted per the conversion tables. Dispatches use `qrspi_dispatch` instead of opencode's `task` tool. Questions use `qrspi_question`.
Acceptance Criteria: AC 6 (Stage 1 artifact production), AC 7 (model tier in frontmatter)
NFRs: NFR: Compatibility (model tier frontmatter)
Gate Criteria: Phase 1 replan gate (Stage 1 agents functional)
